                      </div>
                    <div>
                      <span class="operation-verb post">POST</span>
                      <span class="operation-path">/{index}/_rank_eval</span>
                      </div><p></p>

<p>Evaluate the quality of ranked search results over a set of typical search queries.</p>
<h3 id="topic-required-authorization" class="highlight-container"><span class="anchor-link">
  <a data-after="URL Copied" data-action="click->highlight#highlightFromAnchor" href="#topic-required-authorization">
    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill="#8792a2" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z"></path></svg>

</a>  Required authorization
</span>
</h3>
<ul>
<li>Index privileges: <code class="code-inline">read</code></li>
</ul>
</div>


